of the sampled columns of A, each scaled appropriately, and we form a c×nmatrix Rusing the
corresponding rows of B, again scaled appropriately. The choice of Pand the column and row scaling
are crucial features of the algorithm. When these are chosen judiciously, we show that CRi sag o o d
