1. Introduction. We are interested in developing and analyzing fast Monte
Carlo algorithms for performing useful computations on large matrices. Examplesof such computations include matrix multiplication, the computation of the singularvalue decomposition of a matrix, and the computation of compressed approximatedecompositions of a matrix. In this paper, we present a computational model forcomputing on massive data sets (the pass-eﬃcient model) in which our algorithms
