5. A second matrix multiplication algorithm. In this section we describe
theElementwiseMatrixMultiplication algorithm to approximate the product
of two matrices. First, in section 5.1, we describe the algorithm, its implementation,and running time issues; then in section 5.2 we analyze the algorithm and bound itserror with respect to both the Frobenius and spectral norms. We will see that thealgorithm returns good approximations with respect to the spectral norm but notwith respect to the Frobenius norm.Downloaded 05/10/26 to 76.16.58.116 . Redistribution subject to SIAM license or copyright; see https://epubs.siam.org/terms-privacy

