rithm. In this section we provide further analysis of the BasicMatrixMultiplica-
tionalgorithm. In section A.1 we consider approximating the product of more than
two matrices by a similar sampling process. Then, in section A.2 we examine element-wise error bounds for the algorithm, and in section A.3 we consider error bounds forprobability distributions which are not nearly optimal in the sense of section 4.4.
